# [IEPG](../wg/iepg.html)

## Summary

The IEPG meeting held prior to IETF 121 featured operational DNS research, measurements of the 2024 DNS Root Zone KSK Rollover, analysis of DNS query duplication and retry behavior, and a practical implementation of IPv6 multi-homing for residential networks. Key topics included real-time root DNS monitoring via RIPE Atlas, the amplification effects of `SERVFAIL` responses, and implementation challenges with IPv6 source address selection during uplink failover.

